msgid ""
"| Attribute  | Value                                                                                                       |\n"
"| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Trigger    | Cron only, daily 03:00 (`0 3 * * *`), no manual trigger                                                     |\n"
"| Target     | All active `semantic_memory`                                                                                |\n"
"| Operations | Contradiction detection + expiry marking, split, dedup merge—three sequential rounds                        |\n"
