"过期/废弃（新事实取代）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:137
msgid ""
"## New entries (not in message 1)  f-003 (world) \"Bob works in Pudong, "
"Shanghai\" sources=[s-abc,s-def] observed=2026-05-01T..."
msgstr ""
