#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:152
msgid "### `merge_semantic_memories` Tool"
msgstr "### merge_semantic_memories 工具"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:154
msgid "Program auto-stitches fields; LLM only cares about merged new content:"
msgstr "程序自动处理字段缝合，LLM 只需关心合并后的新 content："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:159
msgid "`source_sessions` → union deduped across source memories"
msgstr "`source_sessions` → 所有源记忆的并集去重"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:159
msgid "`observed_at` → earliest value"
msgstr "`observed_at` → 取最早值"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:159
msgid "Create new memory → deprecate all source_ids"
msgstr "创建新记忆 → 废弃所有 source_ids"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:159
msgid "Only 1 source_id → prompt to use update_semantic_memory"
msgstr "仅 1 个 source_id → 提示使用 update_semantic_memory"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:161
msgid "### Operation Log"
msgstr "### 操作日志"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:163
msgid ""
"Each round written to `~/.anima/logs/deep_sleep_{day}_{round_index}"
"_{round}.json`, not in database, for troubleshooting only."
msgstr ""
"每轮操作记录写入 `~/.anima/logs/deep_sleep_{day}_{round_index}"
"_{round}.json`，不进数据库，仅用于排查。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:165
msgid ""
"Records: date, round, active memory count, prior change count, tool_calls "
"count, summary, change log snapshot."
msgstr ""
"记录内容：当日日期、轮次、active 记忆数、前序变更数、tool_calls 数、summary、"
"变更日志快照。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:167
msgid "## Trigger Mechanism"
msgstr "## 触发机制"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:173
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```cron\n"
"0 2 * * *  light-sleep           # builtin-light-sleep (semantic + limbic + autobiographical)\n"
"0 3 * * *  deep-sleep            # builtin-deep-sleep\n"
"30 5 * * *  memory-reference-sync  # builtin-memory-reference-sync\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```cron\n"
"0 2 * * *  light-sleep           # builtin-light-sleep（语义 + 感性 + 自传体）\n"
"0 3 * * *  deep-sleep            # builtin-deep-sleep\n"
"30 5 * * *  memory-reference-sync  # builtin-memory-reference-sync\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:175
msgid "After downtime, next scheduled run catches up; not a real-time system."
msgstr "宕机后下次对应时刻补跑即可；非实时系统。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:177
msgid "## Historical Backfill (One-Time CLI)"
msgstr "## 历史补跑（一次性 CLI）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:179
msgid ""
"For historical conversations before go-live or after migration, run light "
"sleep **per CST calendar day**, same logic as nightly cron but manually "
"triggered with separate progress file."
msgstr ""
"对上线前或迁移后的历史对话，可按 **CST 自然日**逐日补跑浅睡，与 nightly cron "
"逻辑一致，但由人工触发、独立进度文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:183
msgid ""
"```bash anima memory sleep backfill [--from YYYY-MM-DD] [--to YYYY-MM-DD] [--"
"resume] ```"
msgstr ""
"```bash anima memory sleep backfill [--from YYYY-MM-DD] [--to YYYY-MM-DD] [--"
"resume] ```"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:189
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Option | Description |\n"
#| "| ------ | ----------- |\n"
#| "| `--from` | Start date; if omitted, earliest non-debug session CST day in `sessions` |\n"
#| "| `--to` | End date; if omitted, **yesterday CST** (same as 02:00 cron default day) |\n"
#| "| `--resume` | Continue from progress file, skip completed days |\n"
msgid ""
"| Option     | Description                                                              |\n"
"| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `--from`   | Start date; if omitted, earliest non-debug session CST day in `sessions` |\n"
"| `--to`     | End date; if omitted, **yesterday CST** (same as 02:00 cron default day) |\n"
"| `--resume` | Continue from progress file, skip completed days                         |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 选项       | 说明                                                          |\n"
"| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `--from`   | 起始日；省略时取 `sessions` 中最早非 debug 会话的 CST 日      |\n"
"| `--to`     | 截止日；省略时为 **昨日 CST**（与 02:00 cron 默认处理日一致） |\n"
"| `--resume` | 从进度文件续跑，跳过已完成日                                  |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:191
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Progress file:** `~/.anima/runtime/light_sleep_backfill_state.json` (separate from `light_sleep_state.json`).\n"
msgstr "**进度文件**：`~/.anima/runtime/light_sleep_backfill_state.json`（与 `light_sleep_state.json` 独立）。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:193
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Behavior notes:**\n"
msgstr "**行为要点**：\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:200
msgid ""
"Each day independently calls `runLightSleep({ day })`; single-day failure "
"recorded then continue next day"
msgstr "每日独立调用 `runLightSleep({ day })`；单日失败记录后继续下一天"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:200
msgid ""
"Stage 3b (autobiography summary refresh) runs only on **last day** by "
"default; skipped on intermediate days to save tokens"
msgstr ""
"Stage 3b（自传概括刷新）默认仅在 **最后一天** 执行，中间日跳过以节省 token"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:200
msgid ""
"Before backfill, ensure LLM correctly fills `observed_at` / `occurred_at` "
"(see [`memory.md`](memory.md)); otherwise memory times become backfill moment"
msgstr ""
"补跑前请确保 LLM 能正确填写 `observed_at` / `occurred_at`（见 [`memory.md`]"
"(memory.md)）；否则记忆时间会落成补跑时刻"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:200
msgid ""
"Backfill only writes semantic / limbic / autobiographical; **cross-session "
"semantic merge still relies on deep sleep**—after backfill, wait for 03:00 "
"deep sleep or trigger manually"
msgstr ""
"补跑只写入 semantic / limbic / autobiographical；**跨 session 语义合并仍靠深"
"睡**——补跑结束后建议手动等一次 03:00 深睡或自行触发"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:200
msgid ""
"No conflict with 02:00 cron, but pause service or avoid early-morning window "
"during backfill"
msgstr "与 02:00 cron 无冲突，但建议补跑时暂停服务或错开凌晨窗口"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:200
msgid ""
"Single conversation input still capped at ~**120k characters** (see "
"\"Context Too Large\" above)"
msgstr "单次对话输入仍受约 **120k 字符**限制（见上文「上下文过大」）"

